<title>POLAND: Amerbank Q4 net rises to PLN 3.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Amerbank Q4 net rises to PLN 3.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amerbank SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     5.57    vs   3.40</p>
<p>    net					3.15    vs   2.04</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  5.57    vs   3.40</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Bank Amerykanski w Polsce Amerbank SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   15.10    vs  12.10</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 6.46    vs   6.98</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   3.46    vs   2.23</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  0.34    vs   0.24</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.41    vs   1.36</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMCER:</p>
<p>    operating profit		    16.61    vs   9.86</p>
<p>    net					9.03    vs   6.55</p>
<p>    pre-tax				 16.61    vs   9.86</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   52.04    vs  44.47</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	25.90    vs  24.96</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	  11.02    vs   7.68</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  1.17    vs   0.93</p>
<p>    income tax			     7.58    vs   3.31</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
